WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.870 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.470 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.030
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.630 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.950 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.370 --> 01:04.370
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.880 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.390 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:30.000 --> 01:31.270
Everybody...

01:31.270 --> 01:33.500
Happy New Year!

01:36.580 --> 01:38.610
Thanks for the food!

01:39.270 --> 01:44.540
Man, it's New Year's... Why
are we eating a normal meal?

01:45.050 --> 01:47.550
Chocolat-chan, you wanted to eat later?

01:47.550 --> 01:49.250
That's not what I meant!

01:49.520 --> 01:51.760
This bread is really good.

01:52.090 --> 01:53.820
I baked it!

01:54.360 --> 01:56.320
That's my Vanilla-chama for you.

01:56.320 --> 02:01.800
You're nothing like Chocolat over here
who only screws up every time she cooks.

02:02.160 --> 02:06.800
It's finally New Year's... I really
want to go back to the Magical World!

02:09.340 --> 02:15.880
New Years in the Magical World... Mountains of
ice cream, a cherry-flavored river, candy rain...

02:16.640 --> 02:20.580
The entire ocean changes into
pink soda... It's all you can drink!

02:21.350 --> 02:25.090
The Magical World New Year really is the best.

02:25.720 --> 02:27.960
Then why don't we just go there?

02:27.960 --> 02:30.100
The door in the moon should be out tonight, after all.

02:30.390 --> 02:33.090
We can't. Remember what Robin-sensei said?

02:33.560 --> 02:37.570
Even during New Years, the rules of
the Queen Competition do not change.

02:37.570 --> 02:40.840
If you go back on your own, you are DQed!

02:40.840 --> 02:44.710
And I won't forgive you if your
escorts, Houx and Saule, go back either.

02:45.970 --> 02:46.440
No way.

02:46.440 --> 02:47.180
You've got to be kidding me!

02:47.180 --> 02:49.210
What about you, Sensei?

02:49.210 --> 02:53.580
I'm going back, of course, to date me some girlies.

02:53.580 --> 02:55.750
- That's not fair!
- It's totally fair!

02:55.750 --> 02:58.990
Even though it's New Years
don't forget to gather hearts.

02:58.990 --> 02:59.950
See ya.

03:03.570 --> 03:05.330
I guess it's no use.

03:05.330 --> 03:09.080
We can't help it. And there's
the Ogres to worry about, too.

03:09.530 --> 03:12.540
In that case, have fun with
the Human Worlds New Year's.

03:12.930 --> 03:16.000
Then let's go to Chocolat's friend's house.

03:16.000 --> 03:20.180
But Nanako-chan and Natsume-chan and
everyone are on trips with their families.

03:20.180 --> 03:21.280
There's no one here.

03:23.010 --> 03:24.280
Fine, then.

03:24.280 --> 03:27.580
We'll just go out and see the town on New Years!

03:29.080 --> 03:31.450
A Small Heart, a Heart of Deep Red

03:35.160 --> 03:36.260
I'll go too.

03:36.260 --> 03:37.760
We're off!

03:38.830 --> 03:40.630
Wait for us!

03:47.610 --> 03:49.740
There's no one here at all.

03:49.740 --> 03:52.540
Is everyone out, I guess?

03:52.540 --> 03:53.580
Chocolat!

03:53.910 --> 03:55.840
How about we up the speed a little?

03:55.840 --> 03:57.410
Let's race!

03:57.410 --> 03:59.310
Alright, I ain't gonna lose!

04:00.950 --> 04:02.120
C-C-Chocolat-chan!

04:02.720 --> 04:04.480
Wait for us!

04:05.220 --> 04:07.190
Full throttle!

04:09.220 --> 04:11.460
Chocolat-chan, please stop...

04:12.460 --> 04:15.700
Damn... How about this?

04:23.610 --> 04:24.340
Now!

04:26.870 --> 04:28.780
Kyahoo!

04:28.780 --> 04:29.780
Kya!

04:32.150 --> 04:32.880
Huh?

04:34.620 --> 04:35.650
Alright!

04:35.650 --> 04:37.320
Chocolat-chan, look in front of you!

04:40.490 --> 04:41.990
Brake!

04:51.170 --> 04:52.730
That was dangerous.

04:53.370 --> 04:55.800
Sheesh, Chocolat-chan, you go too far.

04:57.510 --> 04:58.170
What?

05:00.980 --> 05:03.040
Uh... Happy New Year's!

05:06.080 --> 05:07.530
Here, take it.

05:12.590 --> 05:13.250
Thank you.

05:14.990 --> 05:17.120
It's "Surprise Candy." It's yummy.

05:23.300 --> 05:24.670
I'm Chocolat.

05:24.670 --> 05:25.070
I'm Mi-kun!

05:25.070 --> 05:25.550
I'm Mi-kun!

05:26.700 --> 05:28.300
Chocolat, where did you come from?

05:29.540 --> 05:30.430
Over there!

05:30.940 --> 05:32.890
Why'd you come?

05:34.710 --> 05:37.410
I didn't really have any reason, exactly...

05:37.410 --> 05:39.850
Then will you play with me?

05:39.850 --> 05:41.150
Sure, no prob.

05:41.150 --> 05:42.050
Really?

05:42.050 --> 05:42.440
Yeah!

05:42.440 --> 05:44.520
Will you play with me forever?

05:44.520 --> 05:45.690
Sure.

05:45.690 --> 05:47.360
You won't go anywhere?

05:47.360 --> 05:49.220
I won't go anywhere.

05:50.760 --> 05:52.260
Chocolat-chan...

05:52.260 --> 05:54.400
Here, I'll give this to you, Chocolat.

05:54.400 --> 05:55.760
It's my treasure!

05:56.730 --> 05:57.600
Thank you.

05:58.100 --> 05:59.790
Chocolat-chan, who is this kid?

06:01.750 --> 06:04.440
Huh? Isn't this dog... Hiroshi?

06:05.210 --> 06:06.610
Which means...

06:06.610 --> 06:09.800
Hey! Hiroshi! Miharu!

06:11.010 --> 06:12.910
Yup, it's Akira!

06:13.810 --> 06:17.350
Kato, Ice! What are you doing at my house?

06:21.520 --> 06:23.060
Happy New Year's.

06:23.590 --> 06:24.610
It's nice of you to come.

06:24.610 --> 06:27.630
So Miharu-kun is Akira-kun's cousin.

06:27.630 --> 06:29.830
It's New Year's, so he came to play.

06:30.370 --> 06:32.600
We were about to start making mochi.

06:32.600 --> 06:34.970
Huh? What's mochi?

06:35.770 --> 06:36.840
Want to do it with us?

06:37.470 --> 06:39.540
I don't really know what it is, but I'll do it!

06:40.080 --> 06:43.580
Eating freshly pounded
mochi in the yard is really delicious.

06:43.580 --> 06:45.610
Why in the yard? It's cold!

06:47.550 --> 06:51.490
In Africa they have a barbecue
outdoors on New Years and it's a lot of fun.

06:52.220 --> 06:55.060
So then Japanese people should
eat mochi outside too, obviously.

06:56.060 --> 06:57.830
I don't think that's exactly right.

06:57.830 --> 06:59.030
I agree!

06:59.030 --> 07:00.070
We'll do it, too!

07:00.070 --> 07:01.900
Houx, Saule!

07:01.900 --> 07:03.300
Where'd you come from?

07:04.400 --> 07:06.030
Don't worry about the details.

07:06.670 --> 07:08.600
Yup, they're aliens all right.

07:14.980 --> 07:17.610
You've got to be in sync when pounding mochi.

07:17.610 --> 07:19.550
If you loose the tempo you'll get hurt, you see.

07:20.250 --> 07:21.590
You can do it!

07:21.850 --> 07:24.590
Not bad, you two. Your movements are perfect!

07:24.590 --> 07:26.790
I'm next! I'll do it next!

07:27.360 --> 07:28.090
Me too!

07:28.420 --> 07:30.530
Miharu, you're too small, you can't.

07:30.530 --> 07:31.830
You'll hurt yourself.

07:32.630 --> 07:34.330
I can do it.

07:34.330 --> 07:35.930
No, you can't.

07:35.930 --> 07:36.570
But I can...

07:36.930 --> 07:38.400
Wanna do it with me?

07:38.400 --> 07:39.570
Yeah!

07:39.570 --> 07:41.170
I guess so...

07:41.170 --> 07:42.070
Be careful, now.

07:42.540 --> 07:44.010
Vanilla, if you please.

07:44.010 --> 07:45.310
Huh? Me?

07:48.180 --> 07:50.310
Chocolat-chan, be careful, okay?

07:50.310 --> 07:51.610
I know, I know.

07:52.180 --> 07:53.280
Mi-kun, ready?

07:53.280 --> 07:53.780
Yeah!

07:54.150 --> 07:57.250
One, Two, Pound!

07:57.250 --> 07:58.320
Oka .

07:58.320 --> 08:00.080
One, two...

08:02.080 --> 08:03.760
Pound!

08:03.760 --> 08:04.890
Pound...

08:09.960 --> 08:11.030
Chocolat-chan...

08:25.550 --> 08:28.620
Wow, mochi is really good!

08:28.620 --> 08:29.280
It really is.

08:29.620 --> 08:31.310
I remember when I went to Alaska

08:31.310 --> 08:36.020
and how all the people would cook and
eat the seals they caught.

08:36.020 --> 08:41.790
Well, a nature photographer
shouldn't take pride in going out hunting.

08:42.230 --> 08:45.250
It seems Miharu has really
gotten attached to you, Chocolat-chan.

08:45.570 --> 08:49.640
Ah... His mother is in New York on business.

08:49.640 --> 08:51.640
His father died a long time ago.

08:52.570 --> 08:56.640
Since his mother is away
on business a lot, he's lonely.

08:56.640 --> 08:59.810
He's already four. You're too easy on him.

09:00.110 --> 09:03.120
Yeah, well, you're always cryin' for your dad...

09:03.120 --> 09:04.810
No, I'm not!

09:05.190 --> 09:08.860
You always seem gloomy
when your dad isn't around, Akira.

09:08.860 --> 09:10.320
Oh, be quiet!

09:13.190 --> 09:16.100
I see. He's the same as me.

09:16.100 --> 09:18.400
It's lonely without your mother around, isn't it?

09:22.900 --> 09:25.540
Don't worry, there are plenty left.

09:28.180 --> 09:31.010
It's okay if you want to think of me as your mother.

09:34.620 --> 09:35.930
Not my mama...

09:37.690 --> 09:39.790
Chocolat-chan, your peek-a-boo glasses...

09:40.490 --> 09:41.150
A heart?

09:44.160 --> 09:47.660
Hey, that little twerp has a heart for Chocolat!

09:48.160 --> 09:50.660
Don't get jealous of a kindergartner, Saule.

09:52.690 --> 09:55.370
I get his feelings, but what should I do?

09:55.840 --> 09:59.670
And anyway, is it okay for me to
take a heart from such a small kid?

10:03.540 --> 10:04.810
Ta-da!

10:09.350 --> 10:10.420
You've got to be kidding me!

10:10.420 --> 10:11.380
It's the totally wrong image.

10:11.650 --> 10:14.790
Men always say the opposite of what they think.

10:14.790 --> 10:17.360
It's the same in any country, I guess.

10:17.360 --> 10:19.930
Just be honest with yourself.

10:19.930 --> 10:20.900
Chocolat-chan...

10:20.900 --> 10:26.070
I'm glad I had these kimonos of
my little sister's, Miharu's mother.

10:26.070 --> 10:28.900
And I'm even happier that I even
managed to put them on right, somehow.

10:32.040 --> 10:33.650
Chocolat looks like a princess!

10:34.010 --> 10:35.140
A princess?

10:36.080 --> 10:37.880
Have you even SEEN a princess?

10:37.880 --> 10:40.050
I'll whup your laughing butts!

10:40.050 --> 10:43.120
Chocolat-chan, don't
be violent in a kimono!

10:43.480 --> 10:44.880
You're such a nice kid, Mi-kun.

10:47.220 --> 10:49.420
Chocolat-chan, look at Miharu-kun's heart.

10:50.420 --> 10:52.930
It turned pink.

10:53.630 --> 10:56.060
Tomorrow we'll go do the New Year's temple visit.

10:56.500 --> 10:59.070
It's late tonight, so I think
you should go home for now.

10:59.070 --> 10:59.930
Okay!

11:03.440 --> 11:04.870
Chocolat, you're leaving?

11:06.570 --> 11:08.280
I'll be back tomorrow.

11:08.280 --> 11:11.550
But you said that you wouldn't go anywhere!

11:11.550 --> 11:13.190
Well, I said that, but...

11:13.550 --> 11:15.880
Miharu-kun always says that.

11:15.880 --> 11:19.820
I see. With his mother not here, I guess he's lonely.

11:21.620 --> 11:22.460
Mi-kun...

11:23.260 --> 11:25.410
Okay then! I'll stay over here today!

11:26.130 --> 11:26.950
Really?!

11:27.230 --> 11:28.560
Is it okay with you, Oji-san?

11:29.030 --> 11:30.900
It's fine with me.

11:31.670 --> 11:33.670
You got a problem with that?!

11:33.670 --> 11:35.170
No, not exactly.

11:35.170 --> 11:39.540
A girl can't just stay over at a boys place that simply.

11:39.540 --> 11:41.810
But if the knights are to protect their princess...

11:42.280 --> 11:44.970
Meaning, we'll also stay over. Thanks!

11:45.310 --> 11:47.380
If you're staying, then I will too.

11:48.180 --> 11:49.950
Why not?

11:49.950 --> 11:51.440
Everyone, let's have a good time.

11:51.820 --> 11:53.690
I'll sleep with you, Chocolat!

11:53.690 --> 11:55.420
Okay! Let's sleep together!

11:57.190 --> 12:00.030
Hey, Chocolat. You won't go anywhere?

12:01.000 --> 12:02.430
Don't worry.

12:05.370 --> 12:09.800
Even though she's far away, I'm
sure that your mother is thinking of you.

12:10.340 --> 12:17.180
My mother died too, but I can
feel that she is always by my side.

12:19.410 --> 12:20.420
Chocolat...

12:21.020 --> 12:22.920
That's right! After all this, I should...

12:25.750 --> 12:29.920
This oil that Vanilla mixed for me
should give him relaxing dreams.

12:30.420 --> 12:31.220
Alright!

12:32.590 --> 12:34.960
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

12:41.500 --> 12:42.400
Wand!

12:51.050 --> 12:52.110
Alright!

12:52.610 --> 12:54.710
Have a fun first dream of the year!

13:01.890 --> 13:03.420
Mi-kun, look!

13:13.600 --> 13:19.610
One-two, one-two, one-two...

13:28.180 --> 13:30.450
Mi-kun, let's dance too!

13:30.450 --> 13:31.620
Yeah!

13:40.670 --> 13:42.180
Ole!

13:42.380 --> 13:43.630
Ole!

13:45.770 --> 13:47.270
Ole!

13:51.970 --> 13:52.940
Ole!

14:14.500 --> 14:16.080
Hey, let's do the lottery!

14:16.500 --> 14:17.260
Lottery?

14:17.970 --> 14:19.430
It's like fortune telling.

14:22.670 --> 14:23.870
Small blessing.

14:24.370 --> 14:25.270
Near-blessing?

14:25.740 --> 14:26.810
Blessing?

14:27.310 --> 14:28.780
Does that mean you win?

14:29.380 --> 14:31.540
It's not really something you win...

14:32.880 --> 14:34.150
What did I get?

14:34.150 --> 14:35.150
Let's see...

14:35.980 --> 14:37.060
It says "Great Blessing."

14:37.480 --> 14:39.190
That's great, Miharu.

14:40.650 --> 14:43.690
Um... Marriage will go well...

14:43.690 --> 14:45.030
What's "marriage"?

14:45.660 --> 14:49.820
It's when a girl and a boy become a
couple, and promise to be together forever.

14:49.820 --> 14:52.400
I'm gonna get married to Chocolat!

14:52.400 --> 14:54.240
Whoa, it's proposal!

14:54.240 --> 14:55.640
What are you saying?

14:57.040 --> 15:01.780
Miharu, please don't say that, you
have no idea what you're getting into!

15:01.780 --> 15:03.250
What'd you say? I'll whup your butt!

15:03.640 --> 15:05.180
Miharu-kun is really bold.

15:06.480 --> 15:08.520
The little ones sure are honest.

15:08.520 --> 15:11.280
Well, his heart is getting bigger and bigger.

15:11.850 --> 15:13.260
Don't worry about it.

15:13.710 --> 15:16.520
Okay then, I'll do this lottery thing too!

15:17.220 --> 15:17.760
Ow!

15:19.060 --> 15:21.490
If you're worried about your
future, it's the Fortune Telling Book!

15:25.930 --> 15:28.130
Are you competing with the lottery?

15:30.440 --> 15:33.110
The lottery in the Human World
isn't like the Fortune Telling Book.

15:33.110 --> 15:35.610
It doesn't actually tell you your fate.

15:35.610 --> 15:37.040
It's just for peace of mind.

15:37.540 --> 15:39.810
Duke, how long have you been here?

15:39.810 --> 15:42.250
I just came because
I wanted to eat at the food stands!

15:42.520 --> 15:47.250
Fortune Telling Book, I'll call you if I
need my fortune told. Now go home!

15:47.720 --> 15:51.460
Chocolat-chan, she came all
this way, so I'll ask her my fortune.

15:51.460 --> 15:53.660
I didn't do the lottery, after all.

15:53.660 --> 15:54.260
Okay.

15:55.830 --> 15:58.260
Sugar Sugar Rune! Vani Rune!

15:59.500 --> 16:02.040
Divination Libre!

16:10.280 --> 16:12.510
The Shining Door to the Future.

16:12.510 --> 16:16.050
This New Years will be a total success!

16:16.050 --> 16:19.020
However, be careful not to over-eat!

16:24.090 --> 16:26.760
I guess I have to not eat too
much, even if it tastes good.

16:28.960 --> 16:30.700
Oh, it's from your mom, Miharu.

16:31.470 --> 16:32.500
Hello, it's me.

16:33.000 --> 16:35.100
We're doing the temple visit right now.

16:35.770 --> 16:37.940
Oh? I got it.

16:37.940 --> 16:39.410
What'd she say?

16:40.040 --> 16:42.940
She's at the airport right now, and coming this way.

16:43.280 --> 16:44.350
Mama is?

16:44.350 --> 16:45.650
Good for you.

16:46.350 --> 16:46.880
Yeah!

16:47.820 --> 16:50.220
He really seems happy to
be able to meet his mother.

16:50.850 --> 16:52.440
It makes me a little jealous.

16:55.420 --> 16:57.620
Man, I'm beat.

16:57.620 --> 16:59.690
Kimonos are so heavy!

16:59.690 --> 17:01.960
But I'm happy we got to wear them.

17:01.960 --> 17:04.200
I took hearts at the temple, too.

17:04.200 --> 17:07.460
Just like the fortune telling book
said, I've got to do my best this year.

17:09.200 --> 17:14.980
Vanilla-chama in that kimono took a bunch of hearts from the people on the temple visit.

17:14.980 --> 17:16.880
Since when were you...

17:16.880 --> 17:18.910
Since Blanca told me to, I...

17:18.910 --> 17:23.020
Shoot! I was so busy looking after Mi-kun, I forgot!

17:23.520 --> 17:24.490
Duke!

17:24.490 --> 17:25.920
Didn't you realize?

17:27.690 --> 17:30.420
I ate too much mochi, it hurts...

17:30.420 --> 17:32.940
You worthless little... I'll whup your butt!

17:32.940 --> 17:35.630
Just like the Fortune Telling Book said.

17:36.560 --> 17:39.000
Hey, Chocolat-chan, what are you going to do?

17:39.000 --> 17:41.670
Miharu-kun's heart is really radiant.

17:43.870 --> 17:46.510
It's kind of a waste, but I just can't take it.

17:47.110 --> 17:51.380
He's too young... He just thinks I'm his mother.

17:51.650 --> 17:54.710
Do you really look that much like his mother?

17:55.220 --> 17:56.880
That's one scary mom!

17:56.880 --> 17:58.190
I'll kick your butt!

17:58.190 --> 17:59.850
Goal!

18:00.690 --> 18:02.860
But he even proposed to you.

18:03.360 --> 18:08.160
His real mother will be here soon,
and then his heart will disappear.

18:08.600 --> 18:09.400
I see.

18:10.830 --> 18:14.570
It's a little sad, but I'm sure
he'll be happy to see his mother.

18:16.700 --> 18:18.450
Vanilla!

18:27.180 --> 18:29.280
I'm back, Ni-san, Miharu!

18:30.380 --> 18:31.120
Mama!

18:32.490 --> 18:33.790
You're such a mama's boy.

18:33.790 --> 18:35.190
Were you being a good boy?

18:36.560 --> 18:41.070
I'm glad. It's really better
for him to have his real mother.

18:41.360 --> 18:43.530
Miharu-kun's mother is really beautiful.

18:44.260 --> 18:48.300
There's no way he could mistake such a beautiful,
grown-up woman like that for Chocolat.

18:48.300 --> 18:49.570
Such impudence!

18:49.570 --> 18:52.310
Everyone, stop or I'll whup your butt!

18:53.040 --> 18:54.780
Mama, just a second.

18:55.310 --> 18:56.030
Chocolat!

18:57.240 --> 18:59.010
That's a friend of mine from school.

18:59.450 --> 19:02.720
Miharu's been sticking to her the whole time.

19:02.720 --> 19:03.780
How do you do?

19:03.780 --> 19:07.290
You've been looking after Miharu? Thank you.

19:07.290 --> 19:09.060
Are you staying over, Shinobu?

19:09.520 --> 19:12.900
I'd like to, but I have to go back to my place.

19:13.290 --> 19:14.790
You're leaving?

19:16.160 --> 19:18.360
Okay, Miharu, get ready to leave.

19:19.630 --> 19:20.300
Miharu?

19:20.300 --> 19:22.550
I don't wanna go back!

19:27.510 --> 19:30.060
Mi-kun, why are you hiding?

19:30.060 --> 19:31.780
I wanna stay here!

19:31.780 --> 19:34.480
Aren't you happy seeing your mother?

19:34.480 --> 19:37.650
I'm happy being with Mama!

19:38.190 --> 19:40.780
But I'm gonna be with you, too, Chocolat!

19:42.520 --> 19:46.280
Miharu is really glued to you, Chocolat-chan.

19:47.620 --> 19:49.700
It can't be helped, I'll go get him.

19:49.700 --> 19:50.500
Wait!

19:51.670 --> 19:53.580
I'll go convince him.

19:56.840 --> 19:58.240
I understand.

19:58.240 --> 20:00.010
I'm counting on you, Chocolat-chan.

20:00.410 --> 20:00.970
Sure!

20:03.510 --> 20:09.550
Mi-kun, your mama finally came to
pick you up, so go home with her, okay?

20:09.550 --> 20:10.850
Together with you, Chocolat!

20:12.190 --> 20:17.760
I'm okay. You're finally together with
your mother, so isn't that for the best?

20:18.530 --> 20:19.790
Together with Mama...

20:20.530 --> 20:24.900
But I wanna be together with you
Chocolat! All three of us, together!

20:24.900 --> 20:26.620
Mi-kun, that's impossible...

20:26.620 --> 20:29.170
Chocolat, let's get married!

20:29.170 --> 20:31.370
If we get married, we'll always be together!

20:32.640 --> 20:34.370
I love you, Chocolat!

20:34.370 --> 20:35.910
I'm gonna be together with you!

20:38.150 --> 20:40.130
A pure red heart...

20:42.120 --> 20:46.620
Mi-kun, I'm sorry for thinking that you didn't
understand anything because you were too young.

20:47.290 --> 20:49.360
You're young, but your heart is real.

20:49.860 --> 20:53.330
This honest, pure red heart grew in this young kid.

20:55.130 --> 20:56.600
Agrandissment!

20:56.600 --> 20:59.230
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

21:00.170 --> 21:05.440
Your heart... Pick up!

21:16.150 --> 21:19.120
Like this, he can go home with his mother.

21:23.560 --> 21:24.890
Bye-bye Mi-kun.

21:24.890 --> 21:26.030
Let's play again sometime.

21:28.100 --> 21:29.760
And thank you for the red heart.

21:31.000 --> 21:32.700
Nevermind, see you later!

21:39.070 --> 21:42.210
Always saying your feelings straight out like that...

21:42.210 --> 21:46.280
I wonder where that innocent
honesty goes when you get older?

21:47.950 --> 21:50.820
He'll probably have forgotten
me by the time we meet again.

21:51.420 --> 21:52.590
It's kind of sad...

21:53.290 --> 21:55.160
Isn't that for the best?

21:55.160 --> 22:01.400
That's right. It's best if Miharu just
forgets that his first love was Chocolat.

22:01.400 --> 22:04.550
What'd you say?! I'll whup your butt!

22:04.550 --> 22:06.230
Chocolat-chan.

22:06.670 --> 22:12.100
You finally took a red heart,
so please, act more grown-up!

22:23.120 --> 22:29.450
I light a red candle, and whisper:

22:29.540 --> 22:30.950
"Love"

22:31.860 --> 22:35.370
A magic spell.

22:37.500 --> 22:44.780
With you, there's nothing to be afraid of... probably.

22:46.210 --> 22:54.280
Please hold me. Where am I going?

22:55.960 --> 23:00.230
Take me along, take me along,

23:00.830 --> 23:03.890
To the world beyond the moon.

23:04.200 --> 23:11.270
It doesn't matter if everyone stops.

23:12.640 --> 23:16.080
To the world beyond the moon.

23:18.080 --> 23:26.190
I'll be waiting in the real world.

23:26.250 --> 23:35.160
The eternal world of which you spoke.

23:46.740 --> 23:49.580
I was suddenly asked out on a date by Pierre!

23:49.580 --> 23:52.700
This is my chance! This time,
I'm gonna take that guy's heart!

23:53.520 --> 23:56.530
Put out some snazzy clothes...
These'll be perfect!

23:56.530 --> 23:58.810
Okay, Pierre, prepare yourself!

23:59.830 --> 24:02.630
But Pierre in normal clothes is so cool...

24:02.630 --> 24:05.810
B-But, I can't! What am I supposed to do if it's MY heart that comes out?

24:06.360 --> 24:08.360
Next time on Sugar Sugar Rune:

24:08.360 --> 24:10.550
Watch out! Date at the Aquarium

24:11.120 --> 24:13.790
What'll I do if Pierre is really an Ogre?
